Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:16.39,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}The place changes and goes. Like a wind, like clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:30.19,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}Like the traces of the heart, no halt at the places.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:41.69,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}The place is so far away, be far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:54.74,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}people's hand does not reach, so merely has the worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:21:07.04,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}The place is a lofty lord. can't meet nobody put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:19.98,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}We will lose the place. so lofty which changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:31.93,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}Not all were desired. However, we're never sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:46.50,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}still, there is still the place. far away. far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:26.43,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}The place buried in deep snow. like the collapsing castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:39.88,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}like the head of the shade, figure will be thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:51.53,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}The place is a lofty lord. can't meet nobody put on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:23:07.28,eng-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}still, there is still the place. far away. far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.62,0:20:16.39,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}時空荏苒 如風似雲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:30.19,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}宛如心跡 毫不停息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:41.69,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}彼方之遠 支離破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:54.74,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}無法觸及 唯能禮敬
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:21:07.04,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}高高在上 君臨萬物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:19.98,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}轉瞬即逝 變幻莫測
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:31.93,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}絕非遂心 從不氣餒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.82,0:21:46.50,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}約定之地 其路漫漫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:26.43,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}沒入冰雪 搖搖欲墜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:39.88,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}更似暗影 無蹤無跡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:51.53,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}高高在上 君臨萬物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:23:07.28,chs-Ana,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(300,300)}此地永在 其路修遠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:08.82,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:13.55,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡岡崎君 請跟我交往吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.12,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:20.36,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 你一定很困擾對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.75,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突然聽到這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:26.52,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 不說出來我會很難受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:29.96,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 那個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:30.89,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:34.72,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:38.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我們也才剛認識不久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:42.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然經常有跟杏三個人一起吃吃飯什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:46.62,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也 也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:49.96,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並不是說我討厭你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:54.59,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是說從沒當作戀愛對象看待過呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:57.61,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊不 這種說法很失禮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.13,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果這樣也不介意的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.71,0:01:04.83,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要試著交往看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:11.18,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們接下來會逐漸了解對方的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:15.04,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我覺得接下來的時間不是作為朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.40,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是作為男女朋友來度過的話可能也不壞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.71,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這 這也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.01,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從現在起你就是我的女朋友了 可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:29.92,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:34.89,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 眼淚 控制不住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.53,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像是做夢一樣 好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.25,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常開心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.85,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的志願是護士學校啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.25,0:03:26.43,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 那是我從小的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:30.25,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我對將來的事完全沒考慮過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:32.74,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 我認為不用著急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.80,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可不行 如果整天遊手好閒的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.33,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說不定會被你討厭了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:39.93,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這種事絕不可能發生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:44.99,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無論發生什麼事 我都不會討厭岡崎君的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.61,0:03:47.17,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:53.16,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為還從沒有人對我說過這樣的話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:55.32,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微有點感動了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:58.41,chs for CL朋也,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪有…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.05,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 杏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:19.27,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大好的星期天你在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:22.07,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好好陪在椋身邊怎麼行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:24.52,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}笨蛋 別瞎操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.75,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:30.10,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那孩子呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:39.27,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從二年級開始就一直喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:40.62,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:43.43,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 你覺得你們能好好發展下去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.27,0:04:47.36,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}應該能行吧 她既認真又溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:50.45,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臉動不動就紅 所以稍微讓人有點擔心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:55.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯沒錯 不過她的這種地方也很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:05:00.78,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊不 你可真是什麼事都想著妹妹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:06.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不盡是如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:08.39,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:10.87,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.45,0:05:13.62,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟椋接過吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.96,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？ 才 才沒做過那種事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.99,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這怎麼行 你要更主動一些才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:26.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算你這麼說… 我可是第一次跟女生交往啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼要練習一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.44,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接吻的練習
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.55,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.42,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就把我當成椋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:41.25,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正是雙胞胎 感覺上也很像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:43.53,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:05:58.45,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 到此為止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:02.44,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}畢竟是練習 真親了可不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫非你剛才當真了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:10.01,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼可能 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:13.17,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給你個及格分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:14.32,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:16.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再見了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.71,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽說是在那公園裡哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.71,0:06:31.25,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.07,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岡崎不就是那個不良少年嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:34.43,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 是那兩人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.12,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們原來是同班 而且現在關係似乎也很不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:37.87,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:38.53,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇 出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:39.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}笨蛋 噓
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算再怎樣也不能在那種地方 對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.68,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道就沒一點羞恥感嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:46.83,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.43,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好啊 岡崎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:54.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼連你也這樣了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:56.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？ 我跟杏？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:56.81,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要在走廊裡跑！{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:01.41,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經傳遍整個學校了 說你昨天跟杏接了吻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:05.29,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊… 不 那個該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:06.90,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那麼一回事的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.47,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別裝傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.51,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過呢 我也覺得你最近不太正常
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去很開心的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.59,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不說了我沒做過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.72,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再說跟我交往的是她妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:23.12,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？ 你跟藤林椋？ 真的假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:24.88,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有這麼意外嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:27.84,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為你們倆性格完全不一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.21,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是杏的話我倒還能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.99,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別隨便下結論
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.98,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過 這傳聞藤林估計也…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:39.35,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正只要在學校就算不想聽也會傳進耳朵裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:41.49,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 在這兒在這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:47.28,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微陪我一下 不會浪費你太多時間的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.28,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}痛痛痛… 什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.90,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可什麼也沒做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:50.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏 我說…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:07.55,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說啊 說實話確實是難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:11.60,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼啊 我所說的話就那麼奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:15.62,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說回來 一直以來不是從來都沒有過這種感覺嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:20.10,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}應該是那個吧 因為過於接近而無法察覺的心意？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:23.20,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢 差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:28.77,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 讓你見識一下顯而易見的證據吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.95,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:44.80,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然很奇怪啊 你真的喜歡我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:46.20,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:52.20,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果說錯了的話我向你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.39,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏 你應該是喜歡岡崎的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:59.17,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:01.62,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:17.22,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那傢伙 想消除自己跟你的流言才想跟我交往啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:18.98,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}流言什麼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:22.67,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是流言的話 何必做到這種地步呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.01,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:38.10,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說啊 陽平說過的話你可別當真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看著你跟椋關係那麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:44.64,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就想著「我也交個男朋友多好」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:48.63,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後就想乾脆就找陽平好了 於是就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:49.48,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:55.77,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你難道因為這麼簡單的理由就去找男人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.44,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你才是多管什麼閒事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.57,0:10:11.77,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只要想著椋的事就行了 知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.51,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓女朋友擔心的男人最差勁了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:17.50,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再見了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:28.40,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一共八百日元
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.97,0:10:35.85,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:40.73,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想試著叫叫你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:43.76,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不願意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:45.84,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:47.12,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:49.43,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對 像杏還不是直呼我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:55.27,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢 都已經是這種關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:11:01.66,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不介意的話也叫我椋好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.35,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:04.93,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}椋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:06.92,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋 朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:13.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 再見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.21,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.40,0:11:24.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天…見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.73,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去春原那兒好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:33.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牡丹？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:35.77,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.68,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天可是星期天 沒人會來的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牡丹 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:53.71,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:58.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:01.25,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒 沒什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.99,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說起來 你不是跟椋去約會了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都完全濕透了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:15.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:20.20,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別過來 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:25.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只要想著椋的事就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:27.68,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}畢竟你是椋的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在跟這些沒關係吧 你會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:33.93,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說了不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不要管我 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:40.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就別再管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:40.63,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:41.89,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:45.86,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.46,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.00,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別對我這麼溫柔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:09.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是個笨蛋 你對我溫柔的話我會誤會的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:18.24,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好害怕 害怕去告白
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:23.18,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果向你告白 被拒絕了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:27.10,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或許就連朋友也做不成了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:33.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果和你交往了 又會讓椋傷心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:37.29,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然這樣 還不如放棄了好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:41.10,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為只有這樣才不會有人受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:46.32,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 我現在心裡滿是後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:53.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真是笨呢 明明是自己已經決定了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.32,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.29,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.23,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是藤林杏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:04.61,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是椋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.11,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:15.28,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:36.86,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也的確是個難題呢 在雙胞胎之間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:38.96,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是你 會怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我站在你的立場上嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.90,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那還有什麼好說的 自然是兩人都要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.32,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以把你揍到爬不起來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:50.14,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:55.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過說真的 確實是很難辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:58.25,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然這樣乾脆…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:00.23,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:03.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果想跟雙方都保持距離的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.92,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就真是個極品廢柴了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:13.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊 想讓自己一直保持清白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:20.24,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然事已至此 無論怎樣你都會傷害其中一方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:25.18,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我覺得你越晚給出答案 傷害就會越深
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.21,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對你們三人中的任何一人都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:30.87,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:36.33,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}順便 我能再說一句嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:42.27,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的煩惱太奢侈了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:46.02,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:50.18,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 覓食了覓食了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:06.61,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也君
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:10.53,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要跟我說的是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.00,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就我們兩個人了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.02,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是漫畫的話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:21.68,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兩人獨處在放學後的教室裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.55,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定會接吻什麼的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:24.25,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藤林
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:28.58,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼要用姓稱呼我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:35.48,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…一直想著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:39.12,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想輸給姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.08,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.82,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐一直在注視著誰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:51.98,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明明知道 卻仍然去找姐姐商量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.56,0:16:56.57,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說我想跟朋也君搞好關係
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:01.93,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐雖然很吃驚 但還是馬上笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:04.87,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說包在她身上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.35,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明明知道她會那麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:13.34,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也知道自己很卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.64,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.55,0:17:19.78,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此我也想待在朋也君身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.80,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就不能替代姐姐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:28.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我會變得像姐姐一樣主動的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:32.49,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會留長頭髮 也會學習做料理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.21,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會成為朋也君心儀的女生的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:36.81,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:39.82,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:42.81,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不希望你做那些事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:48.40,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想待在朋也君身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:50.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.81,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼下一個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:15.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藤林…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:17.78,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 請假了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.30,0:18:19.04,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 鈴木
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:32.66,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:54.72,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你交往的那些日子我真的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:19:01.19,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我第一次明白被人需要是多麼開心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:08.29,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想就這樣一直跟你好好相處下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:13.19,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是果然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.24,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做了一件最差勁的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:22.39,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明有了你 卻還想著別人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:26.40,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當我注意到這事後 也沒有告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:32.64,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我利用了你的溫柔 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.27,0:19:36.68,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:39.67,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:41.93,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:44.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:50.11,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:52.70,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:54.65,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 你的頭髮…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:57.94,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被罵了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.77,0:20:03.30,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}椋跟我說「不要逃避」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.13,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想著一直這樣下去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:13.88,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不惜傷害椋也要選擇你 這樣卑鄙的事我不想做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.78,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是她卻說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:21.74,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「這是不可能的」 「已經太晚了」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:27.27,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「如果真的喜歡朋也 就不能再逃避了」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:31.74,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我們不管怎樣 總是會有人受到傷害的」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:35.40,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「畢竟我們喜歡上了同一個人」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:40.14,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她現在一定在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:48.02,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們真的是…太晚了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.87,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是覺察 矇混 還是面對
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:54.16,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:59.39,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 這將是最後一次傷害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:04.89,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是那孩子 我 還是朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:08.01,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:13.82,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡你 朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.22,0:21:17.59,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直 一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:20.15,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都喜歡著你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:33.31,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請不要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:34.61,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:38.61,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果接受你的道歉 原諒了你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:42.55,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會讓我感覺這全都是假的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:48.36,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想把那段時光當作珍貴的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:54.02,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是開心的事 悲傷的事 所有的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.07,0:21:58.54,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 請你不要道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.47,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:11.63,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天啊 要去哪兒來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:13.75,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}約好了要去玩的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:16.22,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 抱歉 那個取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:21.08,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為難得椋說想去買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:22.45,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:25.99,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就沒辦法了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.77,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.45,0:22:34.99,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近可真是熱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.56,0:22:36.20,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:40.53,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 我真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:47.96,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你會不會覺得還是跟椋在一起更舒服？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:50.46,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說啊 我可要生氣了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:52.03,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 生氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:55.41,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣我才能稍微安心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:22:58.39,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是有點扭曲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:01.59,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就更直截了當一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:07.86,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.49,0:23:22.15,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朋也
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:24.01,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:30.72,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到夏天了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.56,0:23:32.42,chs for CL杏,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:08.56,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\bord0\blur10\t(0,1000,1,\blur0)}{\1c&H040404&}在那坡道的中途 你漸漸遠去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.59,0:02:08.56,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)\bord2\be3\1a&HFF&}{\1c&H040404&\3c&HA4A09F&}在那坡道的中途 你漸漸遠去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:14.28,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HC380B8&\3c&HF2E3FA&}溫暖的夕陽 留下了無數珍貴的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:19.31,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H5F2536&\3c&HB083B7&}{\t(392,433,1,\1c&H8E6B6C&\3c&HDAC0B8&)}只留我獨自一人　在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:27.09,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H8E6B6C&\3c&HDAC0B8&)}{\t(458,917,1,\1c&H4B251B&\3c&H7D645E&)}{\t(1626,2002,1,\1c&H9C6687&\3c&HE8D9F0&)}{\t(2460,2752,1,\1c&HC9838A&\3c&HE6C6C9&)}{\t(3713,4004,1,\1c&H93464D&\3c&HF7C8C2&)}{\t(5297,5881,1,\1c&H1C8AF6&\3c&HBCD8F9&)}用思念回憶著　這份溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:34.79,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H3B343E&\3c&HE2EDF5&}{\t(320,361,1,\1c&H3D464A&\3c&H408141&)}{\t(778,1738,1,\1c&HC28147&\3c&HE9B997&)}{\t(2614,3781,1,\1c&H625A2B&\3c&HA7C08C&)}{\t(4324,4365,1,\1c&H8C77C0&\3c&HC5BBE9&)}{\t(5825,5867,1,\1c&HE96B0E&\3c&HF4AD4F&)}唯有你　唯有你
